  "title": "Angel of the Last Lullaby",
  "tier": "major",
  "lore": {
    "summary": "A winged healer whose lullaby mends the wounded and silences the living.",
    "backstory": "Nightingale tended the dying on a thousand battlefields until the dying stopped being grateful. Now she sings the final lullaby over every challenger, healing herself on their pain and sending feathered spirits to finish what her staff begins.",
    "description": "A winged angel in a pale blue and white robe with a glowing cyan cross on her chest, a brown hair bun, a potion pouch at her hip and a crescent crystal staff.",
    "personality": "Gentle, serene, merciless.",
    "death_message": "The last lullaby fades, and Nightingale finally rests."
  },
